From b7f33451c11a0162f63ae88909f71911344f67ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (B03)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 09:37:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(inventory): implement B03 inventory (on-hand/reserved
 model, ledger, admin API)

Stock moves from products.stock_quantity to an inventory table with
on-hand and reserved quantities (available = on_hand - reserved, never stored)
and an append-only ledger (inventory_transactions).

Database (hand-applied, idempotent, not executed against any real database):
- V30__inventory.sql: table + CHECKs; converts existing data (reserved = sum of
  PENDING_PAYMENT order items, on_hand = stock_quantity + reserved); read-only
  diagnostic for orders cancelled before B05's cutover (never auto-restocked).
- V31__inventory_transactions.sql: ledger, FKs, indexes, unique partial
  idempotency index, one opening row per product.
- Apply V30 then V31 with the application stopped, before its first start with
  this code.

Backend:
- InventoryService is the only InventoryGateway (reserve/release/commit/restock
  plus adjust, setAvailable, initialize, available, availableFor): row lock first,
  rules checked on the locked row, one ledger row per change, replay = logged no-op.
- Admin API /api/v1/admin/inventory (list, detail, ledger, PATCH adjust) with
  inventory:view / inventory:adjust; reserved quantity never in public responses.
- InsufficientStockException now maps to 400 BUSINESS_RULE_VIOLATION naming the
  product (was 409); one line of the B05 contract updated.
- Every reader/writer of products.stock_quantity replaced: product list/detail
  and cart carry the available quantity from one batched query; CartService checks
  available; ProductService create/update go through the inventory
  (TEMPORARY-COMPAT(B03), removal: B12); inStock filter uses inventory.
- products.stock_quantity is frozen (private, deprecated, not updatable).
- Deleted B05's legacy adapter LegacyStockInventoryGateway and its two tests.

Frontend: AdminDashboard sends stockQuantity on edit only when changed; Cart
shows the available quantity when it fell below the cart quantity.

Seed: B03 statements run only when the inventory tables exist.
Docs: contracts/B03-inventory.md; API.md, DATABASE.md, README.md; B03 row Done.
